### Integration Status
The Speed Insights component is correctly integrated following the official Next.js App Router pattern:

**File**: `frontend/app/layout.tsx`
- Import statement: `import { SpeedInsights } from "@vercel/speed-insights/next";`
- Component placement: Properly placed at the end of the `<body>` tag
- Implementation matches the official documentation for Next.js v13.5+

```typescript
export default function RootLayout({
  children,
}: {
  children: React.ReactNode;
}) {
  return (
    <html lang="en" className="...">
      <body className="...">
        <WorkspaceProvider>
          {children}
        </WorkspaceProvider>
        <SpeedInsights />
      </body>
    </html>
  );
}
```

